=== width 80
[bold,italic,double-underline]Meeting notes, week 42[]

Attendees: Ada, Grace, Linus. Notes by Ada.

[bold,underline]Decisions[]

1. Ship the parser change behind a flag first.
2. Move the nightly build to [bold]03:00[] UTC.
3. Drop support for the [yellow]legacy[] backend after the next release.

[bold,underline]Numbers[]

┌───────────────────┬───────────┬───────────┬────────┐
│ [bold]Metric           [] │ [bold]Last week[] │ [bold]This week[] │ [bold]Change[] │
├───────────────────┼───────────┼───────────┼────────┤
│ Build time (s)    │       412 │       388 │  -6%   │
├───────────────────┼───────────┼───────────┼────────┤
│ Test failures     │        17 │         9 │  -47%  │
├───────────────────┼───────────┼───────────┼────────┤
│ Open bugs         │        63 │        58 │  -8%   │
├───────────────────┼───────────┼───────────┼────────┤
│ Median review (h) │       5.5 │       4.0 │  -27%  │
└───────────────────┴───────────┴───────────┴────────┘

[bold,underline]Snippets we looked at[]

The slow path:

  [magenta]fn[] [blue]lookup[]([cyan]map[]: [magenta]&[]HashMap<String, Vec<[magenta]u32[]>>, [cyan]key[]: [magenta]&str[]) -> [magenta]usize[] {
      map.[cyan]get[](key).[cyan]map[](|[cyan]ids[]| ids.[cyan]len[]()).[cyan]unwrap_or_default[]()
  }

And the shell one-liner that finds the culprit:

  git log[cyan] --since[][magenta]=[]1.week[cyan] --format[][magenta]=[][green]'%h %s'[][magenta] --[] src/parser [magenta]|[] head[cyan] -20[]

[bold,underline]Open questions[]

• Who owns the flaky [yellow]integration::upload[] test?
• Is the [yellow]~~old~~[] benchmark data still valid?
• Do we need a [italic]second[] staging cluster?

[bold,underline]Next week[]

Review the draft at [underline]https://example.com/draft[] and add comments by Friday.
